  "description": "<p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"815\">Stap de arena binnen met <strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"270\">WWE 2K Battlegrounds</strong>, een <strong data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"298\">arcade-worstelgame</strong> waarin actie, spektakel en humor centraal staan. In plaats van de realistische stijl van de hoofdserie kiest Battlegrounds voor over-the-top moves, explosieve effecten en kleurrijke arena’s.<br data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"492\">Speel met tientallen WWE Superstars, voer spectaculaire power moves uit, ontdek unieke speelvelden en vecht in snelle, chaotische matches. Ideaal voor korte sessies, multiplayerplezier en fans van luchtige vechtgames.<br data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"712\">Deze Nintendo Switch-versie verkeert <strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"767\">In Nette Staat</strong> en wordt geleverd met het <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"814\">originele hoesje</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"838\">🎮 Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1074\">\r\n<li data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"891\">💥 <strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"866\">Arcade-worstelgame</strong> met over-the-top actie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<p data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"949\">🧨 Spektaculaire moves, power-ups en speciale arena’s</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"997\">👫 Lokaal en online multiplayer beschikbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1036\">🌟 Groot roster met WWE Superstars</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1074\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1074\">📦 Inclusief <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1072\">origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1100\">📋 Specificaties</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1114\">Platform:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1134\">Nintendo Switch</strong><br data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1137\"><strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1147\">Titel:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1172\">WWE 2K Battlegrounds</strong><br data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1175\"><strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1185\">Genre:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1217\">Arcade fighting / Worstelen</strong><br data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\"><strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1229\">Taal:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1257\">Meertalig (o.a. Engels)</strong><br data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1272\">Spelers:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1307\" data-is-only-node=\"\">1–4 lokaal, online beschikbaar</strong><br data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1310\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1323\">Conditie:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1342\">In Nette Staat</strong><br data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1345\"><strong data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1359\">Inclusief:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1380\">Origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1416\"><strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1416\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand</strong></p>",
